NOTE ON THE DATA. This licence covers the CODE. The derived data committed under
data/processed/ is a transformation of records published by the NBA via
stats.nba.com (bulk archive: shufinskiy/nba_data) and of the public 2015-16
SportVU tracking release (linouk23/NBA-Player-Movements and mirrors,
play-by-play via sealneaward/nba-movement-data). No bulk raw data is committed
here. See README.md ("Provenance") and CLAUDE.md ("Data rights").

NOTE ON AGPL. CLAUDE.md's sixth ground rule requires that any code importing
ultralytics (AGPL) live isolated in its own clearly-marked subfolder. Nothing in
this tree imports it, so no such folder exists; this note records why there is
nothing to look for.
